	(descr "Nexperia BAS16LD SOD882D (D2). Datasheet Rev. 1 p7 Fig 8: body 0.95-1.05 x 0.55-0.65 x 0.40 max, terminals 0.45-0.55 wide x 0.22-0.30 long at 0.65 pitch (terminal outer edge <= 0.475, inner edge >= 0.175). IPC-7351C least density (D109): lands 0.40 x 0.60 at +-0.375 (x 0.175..0.575): toe 0.075 past the body end (0.05 at body L max), 0.10 past the terminal end at max; inner edge at the terminal inner edge at max length (heel 0); width 0.60 = terminal max 0.55 + 0.025 a side. Paste two copper-less apertures 0.28 x 0.46 at +-0.375 (54 %, Nexperia Fig 9 ratio). Courtyard 1.35 x 0.80 (was 1.50 x 0.90). Derived from lib:Nexperia_SOD882D (same frame, pad numbers, 3D model, F.Fab body, no component silk); spec hardware/tools/land_specs/Nexperia_SOD882D_L.json")
